VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://your-deployment.convex.cloud
# Configure server-only secrets through Convex/Vercel dashboards, never VITE_ variables.
# See docs/OPERATIONS.md for deployment, access, backups, and payment configuration.
# Server-only integration variables (set in the intended Convex environment):
# INTEGRATION_TOKEN_KEY: unique 32-byte random key encoded as 64 hexadecimal characters.
# CALENDAR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, CALENDAR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, CALENDAR_GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI
# PLAID_CLIENT_ID, PLAID_SECRET, PLAID_ENV (sandbox or production), optional PLAID_REDIRECT_URI
# Never prefix these secrets with VITE_. Keep preview/development separate from production.
# CARD_PAYMENTS_DISABLED=true is a server-only checkout kill switch; never enable
# PAYMENTS_TEST_MODE in production. Test keys cannot open non-sandbox checkouts.
